{"id":4468,"title":{"romaji":"Ao no Exorcist: Yosuga-hen","english":"Blue Exorcist -The Blue Night Saga-","native":"青の祓魔師 終夜篇"},"slug":"ao_no_exorcist_yosuga_hen","synopsis":"Sequel to Ao no Exorcist: Yuki no Hate-hen.\n\nYukio parts ways with Rin and makes his way to the Illuminati.\n\nIn order to face Yukio, who is seeking strength and the truth, Rin decides that he must learn the secret of their birth. With Mephisto’s guidance, he embarks on a journey to the past.\n\nRin traces the footsteps of their adoptive father, Shiro Fujimoto, and birth mother, Yuri Egin. But the path they took in life was harsher than Rin could have ever imagined....\n\nWhy were children born between the Demon God Satan and a human?\n\nWhat was the Blue Night?\n\nAnd when Rin learns everything, what will be his answer...?","format":"TV","season":"WINTER","year":2025,"createdAt":"2025-01-05 01:14:41","updatedAt":"2025-01-05 01:14:41","resources":{"nodes":[{"site":"LIVECHART","externalId":12743},{"site":"ANIDB","externalId":18735},{"site":"ANILIST","externalId":185880},{"site":"ANN","externalId":32874},{"site":"KITSU","externalId":49040},{"site":"MAL","externalId":59226},{"site":"OFFICIAL_SITE","externalId":null},{"site":"X","externalId":null},{"site":"CRUNCHYROLL","externalId":null},{"site":"ANIME_PLANET","externalId":24738}]},"images":{"nodes":[{"id":12334,"facet":"SMALL_COVER","path":"anime/small-cover/4PDXaplJxC50v5nVUJqbDNE4f65TCTESNlkNWoad.avif"},{"id":12335,"facet":"LARGE_COVER","path":"anime/large-cover/Qm887sNPXoQgAKdTvGeYkcmpAGuphos6EQAxrBne.jpg"}]},"studios":{"nodes":[{"id":86,"name":"Studio VOLN","slug":"studio_voln"}]},"series":{"nodes":[{"id":346,"name":"Ao no Exorcist","slug":"ao_no_exorcist"}]},"animethemes":[{"id":13371,"slug":"OP1","type":"OP","sequence":null,"song":{"id":13307,"title":{"romaji":"Tsuukaku","native":null}},"animethemeentries":[{"id":15644,"version":1,"episodes":"1-12","nsfw":false,"spoiler":false,"videos":{"nodes":[{"id":18446,"basename":"AoNoExorcistS5-OP1.